  "description": "Production-ready, fail-closed file and stream encryption for .NET 10. Authenticated AES-256-GCM containers with chunked streaming and progress, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 or Argon2id key derivation, atomic file output, zeroable passphrases, and a non-sensitive EventSource for SIEM/OpenTelemetry. The IContentKeyProvider envelope-key seam wraps content keys with an external KMS/HSM so the master key never enters your process. AES-256 keeps data confidential against a harvest-now-decrypt-later quantum adversary. The .pqfe v2 container format is FROZEN for the 1.x line — pinned by published cross-implementation test vectors against a Rust/WASM reference. Production post-quantum public-key encryption ships as the companion package PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Hybrid (X25519 + ML-KEM-768 combiner with multi-recipient support). AOT-compatible; deterministic builds; SourceLink; CycloneDX SBOM and SLSA-style build-provenance attestation on every release; public API surface locked by Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers.",
