  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc.3 — final polish pass before 1.0.0. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for 1.x. Documentation polished for production-grade positioning: README restructured with \"Why this library\" / \"When to use this\" sections and inline supply-chain verification commands; new docs/MIGRATION.md (from age, libsodium, OpenSSL, .NET AesGcm, BouncyCastle/CMS, ProtectedData, IDataProtector) and docs/SUPPLY-CHAIN.md (SBOM, attestation, conformance-vector verification recipe). ROADMAP, SECURITY, and KNOWN-GAPS refreshed to reflect 1.0 reality (stale pre-1.0 entries removed). Adds NoOracleTests pinning the no-decryption-oracle property across wrong-key / flipped-tag / flipped-ciphertext / flipped-header paths. EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.2 baseline. No format, public-API, or runtime-dependency changes.",
